<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVAN LEU NUDGES UP TO 4.6 PER U.S. DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVAN LEU NUDGES UP TO 4.6 PER U.S. DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu nudged up to 4.600 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.602 on June 16.</p>
<p>				   June 24     June 23</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.6	   4.602</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   400,000     500,000</p>
